{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]dil ki girah khol
[A#]do chup [C]na baitho, [Dm]koi geet gao
[A#]mehaphil me ab [Gm]kon hai ajanabi,
[F]tum mere pass aao
[Dm]milne do ab [A#]dil se dil ko,
[Gm]mitne do [F]majburiyon ko
[A#]shishe me [Gm]apne dubo do,
[C]sab faslo [Dm]duriyon ko
[Dm]ankhon me [A#]mai muskuraoon
[A#]tumahari [C]jo [Dm]tum muskurao
[A#]mehaphil me ab [Gm]kon hai ajanabi,
[F]tum mere pass aao
[Dm]hum tum na [A#]hum tum rahe ab,
[Gm]kuch aur hi [F]ho gaye ab
[A#]sapanoki zilmil [Gm]nagar me,
[C]jaane kaha [Dm]kho gaye ab
[Dm]humrah puche [A#]kisi se
[A#]na [C]tum apni [Dm]manjil batao
[A#]mehaphil me ab [Gm]kon hai ajanabi,
[F]tum mere pass aao
[Dm]kal hamse [A#]puche na koi,
[Gm]kya ho gaya [F]tha tumhe kal
